<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus T-bill repo yield at 5.66 percent.</title>
<headline>Cyprus T-bill repo yield at 5.66 percent.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on a reverse repo auction of fourteen-day treasury bills on Wednesday was 5.66 percent, down 0.01 points from the average yield of eight day bills sold on October 24, the Cyprus central bank said.</p>
<p>Bids from commercial banks totalled 18.5 million Cyprus pounds for the eight million pounds worth of bills on offer.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
